            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ũlii wa vetha ũtanamba kũthaw’a, kana mbakũli ya thaavu kũawa, kana kĩtete kũaĩwa nthongonĩ, kana ndĩa kũtw’ĩkĩa kĩthimanĩ, ",
          "type": "text",
