              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũndũ ũngĩ, nĩkwĩthĩwa Mũtavan’ya aĩ mũĩ, aendeea na kũmanyĩsya andũ ũmanyi; ĩĩ, nĩwasũanĩaa, na kũmantha, na kwaĩĩa nthimo nyingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
